{"created": "2026-04-13T13:19:39.467045+00:00", "modified": "2026-04-13T13:19:39.748791+00:00", "id": 19555109, "conceptrecid": "17591931", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.19555109", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.17591931", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.19555109", "metadata": {"title": "tum-ees/DegradationModeAnalysis: DegradationModeAnalysis v2.0.0", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.19555109", "publication_date": "2026-04-13", "description": "<h2>DegradationModeAnalysis v2.0.0</h2>\n<p>v2.0.0 is a breaking cleanup release that standardizes naming across the MATLAB DMA framework and refactors <code>import_ocv</code> for more robust data import and CU-folder handling.</p>\n<h3>Highlights</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Breaking:</strong> renamed the main entry point from <code>main_DMA</code> to <code>main_dma</code></li>\n<li><strong>Breaking:</strong> renamed the main output struct from <code>Data</code> to <code>data</code></li>\n<li><strong>Breaking:</strong> renamed <code>generate_si_OCP</code> to <code>generate_si_ocp</code></li>\n<li><strong>Breaking:</strong> all file and folder names now use <code>snake_case</code>; variables, struct fields, and function parameters now use <code>lowerCamelCase</code></li>\n<li>Refactored <code>import_ocv</code> with case-insensitive column matching and case-insensitive name-value parsing</li>\n<li>Improved CU-folder import handling and added <code>fileNameFilter</code></li>\n<li>Reworked helper-function naming and documentation to align with the new conventions</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Added</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><code>import_ocv</code> now accepts <code>RPT</code>, <code>RPTs</code>, and <code>RPTNumber</code> columns for row lookup</li>\n<li>Case-insensitive column matching in <code>import_ocv</code></li>\n<li>Case-insensitive name-value parsing in <code>import_ocv</code></li>\n<li><code>fileNameFilter</code> for selecting specific MAT files in CU-folder mode</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Changed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Renamed <code>CheckUp</code> to <code>checkUpIndex</code> in <code>import_ocv</code> and <code>get_full_cell_data</code></li>\n<li>Renamed internal solver bundle from <code>myData</code> to <code>solverInput</code></li>\n<li>Renamed <code>inputIsAging_data_table</code> to <code>inputIsAgingDataTable</code></li>\n<li>Renamed internal silicon-graphite references from <code>SiC</code> to <code>SiGr</code></li>\n<li>Simplified RMSE handling in <code>plot_dma</code> to use <code>rmseFullRange</code></li>\n<li>Rewrote <code>README.md</code> to reflect the current API and naming</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Fixed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed <code>varargin</code> handling in <code>get_full_cell_data</code> CU-folder calls</li>\n<li>Fixed missing <code>nameTableColumnOCV</code> and <code>inputIsAgingDataTable</code> arguments in CU-folder mode calls to <code>import_ocv</code></li>\n<li>Fixed UTF-8 encoding issues in comments</li>\n<li>Removed dead inhomogeneity debug code and tracked <code>.DS_Store</code> files</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Migration Notes</h3>\n<p>If you are upgrading from <code>v1.2.1</code>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Replace <code>main_DMA(...)</code> with <code>main_dma(...)</code></li>\n<li>Replace <code>generate_si_OCP(...)</code> with <code>generate_si_ocp(...)</code></li>\n<li>Replace <code>CheckUp</code> with <code>checkUpIndex</code></li>\n<li>Review custom scripts for renamed files, folders, and setting/field names</li>\n</ul>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Mathias Rehm", "affiliation": "Technische Universit\u00e4t M\u00fcnchen"}, {"name": "Josef Eizenhammer", "affiliation": "Technical University of Munich"}, {"name": "Moritz G\u00fcnthner", "affiliation": null}], "related_identifiers": [{"identifier": "https://github.com/tum-ees/DegradationModeAnalysis/tree/v2.0.0", "relation": "isSupplementTo", "resource_type": "software", "scheme": "url"}], "version": "v2.0.0", "custom": {"code:codeRepository": "https://github.com/tum-ees/DegradationModeAnalysis"}, "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "mit-license"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 10, "is_last": false, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "17591931"}}]}}, "title": "tum-ees/DegradationModeAnalysis: DegradationModeAnalysis v2.0.0", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19555109", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/19555109", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/19555109?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.19555109", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.19555109", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.19555109", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19555109/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/17591931", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/17591931", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.17591931", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.17591931", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:19555109/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:19555109/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19555109/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19555109/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19555109/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/19555109/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19555109/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19555109/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19555109/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19555109/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19555109/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19555109/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19555109/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19555109/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19555109/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/19555109/